<view class="container">
  <view class="form-section card">
    <view class="section-title">为项目立碑</view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">项目名称 *</view>
      <input style="height: 72rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box" class="form-input" placeholder="请输入项目名称" value="{{formData.title}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="title" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">行业分类 *</view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{industries}}" value="{{industryIndex}}" bindchange="onIndustryChange">
        <view class="picker" style="height: 72rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box">{{industries[industryIndex] || '请选择行业'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">项目简介 *</view>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="简要介绍你的项目..." value="{{formData.description}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="description" maxlength="500" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-item half">
        <view class="form-label">持续时间（月）*</view>
        <input style="height: 72rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box" class="form-input" type="number" placeholder="例如：6" value="{{formData.duration}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="duration" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item half">
        <view class="form-label">团队规模（人）*</view>
        <input style="height: 72rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box" class="form-input" type="number" placeholder="例如：3" value="{{formData.teamSize}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="teamSize" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">总投入（元）*</view>
      <input style="height: 72rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box" class="form-input" type="number" placeholder="例如：100000" value="{{formData.cost}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="cost" />
    </view>

    <view class="divider"></view>

    <!-- 根因 / 死因两层结构。
         这是本项目最重要的一个表单设计，理由见下方说明块：
         自由文本会导致 70% 的记录退化成「钱烧完了」 -->
    <view class="cause-block">
      <view class="cause-title">它是怎么死的</view>
      <view class="cause-why">
        大多数复盘只写「钱烧完了」。但资金耗尽几乎总是最后死因，
        不是根本原因。分开填，这张数据库才可能回答「大家都是怎么死的」。
      </view>

      <view class="form-item">
        <view class="form-label">根本原因 *</view>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{causeRoots}}" range-key="label" value="{{rootIndex}}" bindchange="onRootChange">
          <view class="picker picker-caused {{rootIndex >= 0 ? 'picker-filled' : ''}}">
            {{rootIndex >= 0 ? causeRoots[rootIndex].label : '请选择根本原因'}}
          </view>
        </picker>
        <view class="cause-desc" wx:if="{{rootIndex >= 0}}">{{causeRoots[rootIndex].desc}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="form-item">
        <view class="form-label">最终死因 *</view>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{causeSymptoms}}" range-key="label" value="{{symptomIndex}}" bindchange="onSymptomChange">
          <view class="picker picker-caused {{symptomIndex >= 0 ? 'picker-filled' : ''}}">
            {{symptomIndex >= 0 ? causeSymptoms[symptomIndex].label : '请选择死因'}}
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="divider"></view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">失败过程 *</view>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="从什么时候开始不对劲的？中间发生了什么？" value="{{formData.failureReason}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="failureReason" maxlength="2000" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">经验教训 *</view>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="从这次创业中你学到了什么？" value="{{formData.lessonsLearned}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="lessonsLearned" maxlength="1000" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">市场潜力评估</view>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="你认为这个方向还有市场机会吗？" value="{{formData.marketPotential}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="marketPotential" maxlength="500" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">标签</view>
      <view class="tags-input">
        <view wx:for="{{formData.tags}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag">
          {{item}}
          <text class="tag-close" bindtap="removeTag" data-index="{{index}}">×</text>
        </view>
        <input class="tag-input" placeholder="添加标签后回车" value="{{newTag}}" bindinput="onTagInput" bindconfirm="addTag" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">项目照片</view>
      <view class="photo-upload-section">
        <view class="photo-list">
          <view wx:for="{{formData.photos}}" wx:key="*this" class="photo-item">
            <image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="previewPhoto" data-index="{{index}}" class="photo-img" />
            <view class="photo-delete" bindtap="removePhoto" data-index="{{index}}">×</view>
          </view>
          <view class="photo-add" bindtap="choosePhoto" wx:if="{{formData.photos.length < 9}}">
            <text class="photo-add-icon">+</text>
            <text class="photo-add-text">添加照片</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="tips">
      <view class="tips-title">📝 发布提示</view>
      <view class="tips-text">
        根因与死因是必填的。这两项决定了别人能不能从你的经历里拿到判断，
        填「其他」也可以，但请在下方把话说明白。所有内容将公开可见。
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="submit-btn btn-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
      {{submitting ? '发布中...' : '立碑纪念'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
